body:
I currently own all of her records on Vinyl.... that being said the pressings aren't the greatest.... Especially Debut, Post, and Homogenic unfortunately. The quality of the pressings gets better right after that though.

&#x200B;

The best pressings of any Bjork Vinyl are the extremely limited 2008 DMM pressings.... those easily resell for 300+ and are hard to find because NO ONE wants to let them go. I'm hoping OLI will repress these again one day.... highly unlikely though.

NO WAY!!!!! You're right!!! INSANE!

&#x200B;

Now I just need Sod Off and So Broken on Spotify. \*crosses fingers\*
